OL,3,AJeff Bezos says he was 'heavily
OL,4,Ainvolved' in casting Robert Pattinson
OL,5,Aas new 007
OL,6,
OL,7,FAmazon founder Jeff Bezos has said he
OL,8,Fwas "heavily involved" in picking actor
OL,9,FRobert Pattinson for the role of James
OL,10,FBond in the next 007 film.
OL,12,FSpeaking at an event in California, the
OL,13,FAmazon CEO said he was originally
OL,14,F"biased against" Pattinson - who
OL,15,Fstarred in a number of blockbuster
OL,16,Ffilms including Batman and the Twilight
OL,17,Ffranchise - "because he's already so
OL,18,Ffamous".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
